    publishedAt: "2026-06-11",
    bodyHeadings: {"data": {"ja": "アンダーコンサンプション・コアとは？2.3億回再生の背景", "en": "What is Underconsumption Core? Behind 230M views"}, "explanation": {"ja": "なぜ「買わない」が刺さる？もったいない・侘び寂びとの一致", "en": "Why buying less resonates: mottainai and wabi-sabi"}, "practice": {"ja": "アンダーコンサンプションの始め方——暮らしの3つのヒント", "en": "How to start: 3 tips for everyday life"}, "cta": {"ja": "まとめ：買わない美学は日本の知恵から", "en": "The takeaway: the aesthetic of less, rooted in Japan"}},
    thumbnail: "/images/posts/006/006-thumbnail.jpg",
    thumbnailAlt_ja: "シンプルな棚と使い込んだ日用品",
    thumbnailAlt_en: "Minimal shelf with well-used everyday items",
    bodyImage1: "/images/posts/006/006-1.jpg",
