    bodyHeadings: {"data": {"ja": "Bed Rottingとは？1億回再生と「休めない」時代のデータ", "en": "What is Bed Rotting? 100M views and a rest-starved era"}, "explanation": {"ja": "なぜ休息が要る？DMNと日本の「たそがれる」文化", "en": "Why rest matters: the Default Mode Network and tasogare"}, "practice": {"ja": "Bed Rottingの取り入れ方——健康的な休息3つの区別", "en": "How to practice Bed Rotting: 3 distinctions for healthy rest"}, "cta": {"ja": "まとめ：「何もしない」は脳の深い仕事時間", "en": "The takeaway: doing nothing is the brain's deep work"}},
    thumbnail: "/images/posts/003/003-thumbnail.jpg",
